    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1187">

                <pb facs="0963" n="847" xml:id="pg847"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.11/6960.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Simpich to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Nogales</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-11-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 23, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Answering Department’s telegram November 22. Obregon replies from Agua Prieta:
                        <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Referring to your message. As I said to you in my former message, orders
                            have already been given to crush the rebels who are operating at Los
                            Mochis.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Simpich.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
